-- These 15 store the tenant as text rather than uuid, so the comparison stays
-- in text: casting the setting to uuid raises "operator does not exist:
-- text = uuid" and leaves the table with RLS on and no policy, which denies
-- everything. Worth normalising these columns to uuid later.
